    <li>128GB+ storage across 2 cards (backup is critical)</li>
    <li>Lightweight travel tripod for blue hour architecture</li>
    <li>Lens cleaning wipes (individually sealed, not the spray bottle type)</li>
    <li>Plastic rain cover for camera (desert sand is worse than rain)</li>
  </ul>
